# keybindings.mayu - 窓使いの憂鬱 (mayu) main config.  EDIT ME.
#
# Running mayu.exe reads this file (and its includes) and registers every
# binding into the Windows registry under HKCU\Software\Mayu\<os>, then
# starts the remapper.  Change 'os win11' to 'os win10' by hand if the
# auto-detection ever guesses wrong.

os win11

include "emacs.mayu"
include "vim.mayu"
include "apps.mayu"
